fixture tech02_running_jump_falls
doc Control for tech 2: a full-speed running full jump from the edge does not clear the chasm the dash-jump clears
room test/chasm
spawn 100 384
frames 120
input
  0..42 R
  43..90 R jump
  91..119 R
end
expect
  mark edge 0..60 event.jump=1
  at edge vx=2304 x>470u
  mark fall 60..119 event.hazard=1
  at fall x<2144u
end
